# Workspace level ignores.

# ── Signing secrets. Never commit these. ──────────────────────────────────
# A leaked keystore lets anyone publish an update that Android will accept as
# genuine MPTree. A lost keystore means you can never update existing installs.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
key.properties
*.p12
*.pem

# ── Local tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
local.properties
.idea/
.gradle/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.apk
*.aab

# Seeded design canvas: a 2.6 MB build output, re-made by seed-canvas.mjs
Branding/website-redesign/*.html
!Branding/website-redesign/*.dc.html

# ── Dashboard credentials and output ──────────────────────────────────────
# The collector reads live numbers from Cloudflare, Google Play and Cusdis.
# Its keys and its output are local only: a leaked Play service account key
# can read everything about the app in the Play Console.
Dashboard/secrets.env
Dashboard/data.json
Dashboard/*service-account*.json

# The published dashboard, rebuilt by collect.mjs from dashboard.html
Dashboard/dashboard.build.html
